<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>科研文献工作台 · v6（v5 交互 + 真实 API）</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
:root{--bg:#f6f7fb;--panel:#fff;--ink:#1f2430;--muted:#6b7280;--line:#e6e9f2;--accent:#4c6ef5;--accent2:#12b886;--warn:#f59f00;--danger:#e03131;--radius:12px;--shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(30,41,80,.07)}
body{font-family:-apple-system,"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
#topbar{height:56px;background:var(--panel);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 20px;gap:18px;position:relative;z-index:50}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap}
.brand .logo{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px}
.tabs{display:flex;gap:4px;flex:1;justify-content:center}
.tab{padding:8px 20px;border-radius:9px;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer;border:none;background:transparent}
.tab:hover{background:#eef1fb;color:var(--ink)}
.tab.active{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;font-weight:600}
.top-right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
#btnUpload{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
#btnUpload:hover{filter:brightness(1.08)}
#btnAI{background:#fff;color:var(--accent);border:1px solid #c5d0f5;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 14px;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer}
#btnAI.on{background:#eef2ff;border-color:var(--accent)}
#statusbar{height:28px;background:#eef1fb;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:0 20px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
#statusbar .dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--muted);display:inline-block;margin-right:5px}
#statusbar.live .dot{background:var(--accent2)}
#statusbar.fake .dot{background:var(--danger)}
#statusbar b{color:var(--ink)}
#statusbar .right{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:14px}
#main{flex:1;display:flex;overflow:hidden}
#content{flex:1;overflow:auto;padding:20px 24px}
#aiPanel{width:320px;background:var(--panel);border-left:1px solid var(--line);display:none;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden}
#aiPanel.on{display:flex}
/* 工具栏 */
.toolbar{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
#search{flex:1;min-width:220px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px;outline:none}
#search:focus{border-color:var(--accent)}
.switch-btn{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel);border-radius:9px;padding:9px 14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}
.switch-btn.active{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent)}
select.mini{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;padding:8px 10px;font-size:13px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);outline:none}
.viewhint{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
/* 布局 */
/* 布局（v7：单列栅格 + 顶部统一控件区） */
#view-lib{display:flex;flex-direction:column;height:100%}
#view-lib.hidden{display:none}
.lib{display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:1;min-height:0}
/* ==== v7 顶部统一控件区（维度行 / 取值行 / 已选行，两视角同址） ==== */
#ctrlBar{background:var(--panel);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:10px 14px;margin-bottom:14px}
.ctrl-row{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.ctrl-row:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.ctrl-lb{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;min-width:32px;line-height:26px;flex:none}
.ctrl-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center;min-width:0}
.ctrl-note{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:26px}
.ctrl-acts{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:12.5px}
.ctrl-acts .sel-n{color:var(--muted)}
.mini-link{border:none;background:transparent;color:var(--accent);cursor:pointer;font-size:12.5px;padding:0;font-family:inherit}
.mini-link:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.ctrl-empty{font-size:12px;color:#adb5bd;line-height:26px}
.val-wrap{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center;min-width:0;flex:1}
.val-wrap.open{max-height:148px;overflow-y:auto}
.val-wrap:not(.open) .vx{display:none}
#view-lib.narrow .val-wrap{flex-wrap:nowrap;overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:4px}
.fchip{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:4px 11px;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;white-space:nowrap}
.fchip:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}
.fchip.on{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:#fff}
.more-btn{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#f1f3f5;border-radius:20px;padding:4px 11px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;white-space:nowrap}
.more-btn:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent)}
.sel-tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:#eef2ff;border:1px solid #dbe2ff;color:var(--accent);border-radius:20px;padding:3px 6px 3px 11px;font-size:12px}
.tag-x{border:none;background:transparent;color:var(--accent);cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;line-height:1;padding:0 3px;font-family:inherit}
.dimbtn{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:5px 14px;font-size:12.5px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink);font-family:inherit}
.dimbtn:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}
.dimbtn.on{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent)}
/* 列表 */
.paperlist{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;max-width:1080px}
.pcard{background:var(--panel);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:14px 16px;cursor:pointer;border:2px solid transparent}
.pcard:hover{border-color:#c5d0f5}
.pcard.sel{border-color:var(--accent);background:#fafbff}
.pcard .t{font-size:14.5px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:5px}
.pcard .meta{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}
.pcard .kw{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;margin-bottom:6px}
.kwtag{background:#eef2ff;color:var(--accent);border-radius:20px;padding:2px 9px;font-size:11px}
.pcard .sum{font-size:12.5px;color:#495057;line-height:1.55;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden}
.pcard .ai{font-size:11px;color:var(--accent2);margin-top:5px}
/* 图谱 */
.graphbox{background:var(--panel);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);overflow:hidden;position:relative;height:100%;min-height:460px}
#graphWrap{width:100%;height:100%;cursor:grab;overflow:hidden;position:relative;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,#ffffff,#f3f5fb)}
#gHost{position:absolute;inset:0;overflow:hidden}
#graphWrap:active{cursor:grabbing}
#graphSvg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}
.g-node{cursor:pointer}
.g-node.dim circle{stroke:#fff;stroke-width:2}
.g-node.paper circle{stroke:#fff;stroke-width:1.5}
.g-node text{font-size:11px;fill:#495057;pointer-events:none}
.g-node.dim text{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;fill:#1f2430}
.g-edge{stroke:#c9d2ea;stroke-width:1.2;opacity:.55}
.legend{position:absolute;right:14px;bottom:14px;z-index:6;background:rgba(255,255,255,.72);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(6px);border:1px solid rgba(230,233,242,.8);border-radius:10px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(30,41,80,.08);max-width:260px;line-height:1.6;transition:background .15s ease,box-shadow .15s ease}
.legend:hover,.legend:focus-within{background:rgba(255,255,255,.95);box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(30,41,80,.12)}
.legend b{color:var(--ink)}
.lg-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
.legend-toggle{margin-left:auto;border:none;background:transparent;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer;font-size:12px;line-height:1;padding:0 2px;font-family:inherit}
.legend-toggle:hover{color:var(--accent)}
.lg-body{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px 10px;margin-top:5px}
.lg-item{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap}
.lg-dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;flex:none}
.lg-shape{color:#adb5bd;font-size:10.5px}
.legend.collapsed{padding:4px 10px}
.legend.collapsed .lg-body{display:none}
.legend.collapsed .legend-toggle{transform:rotate(180deg)}
/* ==== v7 图谱交互增强 ==== */
#paperArea{flex:1;min-height:0;overflow:auto;transition:padding-right .25s ease}
#paperArea.rel-open{padding-right:352px}
#paperArea.rel-open:has(#graphWrap){padding-right:0}
.ghud{position:absolute;top:10px;right:12px;display:flex;gap:6px;z-index:5}
.ghud button{border:1px solid #dfe3f0;background:rgba(255,255,255,.95);color:#3b4256;border-radius:8px;
  padding:5px 8px;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 1px 5px rgba(30,41,80,.08);font-family:inherit;line-height:1}
.ghud button:hover{background:#f1f3fb;border-color:#c7cff0;color:#2b3d8f}
.ghud button:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:default}
.ghud button:disabled:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.95);border-color:#dfe3f0;color:#3b4256}
.ghud button.busy{color:#2b3d8f}
.ghud button.busy span{display:inline-block;animation:ghudspin .9s linear infinite}
@keyframes ghudspin{from{transform:rotate(0)}to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
.g-node text{pointer-events:none}
.g-node .g-label{font-size:9.5px;fill:#343a40;stroke:#fff;stroke-width:2.6;paint-order:stroke;stroke-linejoin:round}
.g-node .g-label.hub{font-size:10.5px;fill:#1f2430;font-weight:600}
.g-node.dim .g-label{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;fill:#1f2430;stroke:#fff;stroke-width:3}
.g-node.sel polygon,.g-node.sel rect,.g-node.sel circle{stroke:#212529;stroke-width:2.2}
.g-edge{transition:stroke-opacity .15s,stroke-width .15s}
.rel-adj{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;margin:2px 0 10px}
.rel-adj span{cursor:pointer;font-size:11.5px;background:#f1f3f9;border:1px solid #e3e7f3;border-radius:6px;
  padding:2px 7px;color:#3b4256;max-width:150px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
.rel-adj span:hover{background:#e7ecff;border-color:#b9c6f5;color:#2b3d8f}
.rel-adj span .dot{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:4px;vertical-align:middle}
.rel-adj span.on{background:#e7ecff;border-color:#93a5f0}
.rel-kind{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0 4px;font-weight:600}
.rel-kind em{font-style:normal;color:#adb5bd;font-weight:400}
.kv{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;font-size:12.5px;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #eef0f7}
.kv i{font-style:normal;color:var(--muted);flex:0 0 auto}
.kv b{font-weight:500;color:#212529;text-align:right;word-break:break-all}
.rel-badge{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:99px;background:#eef1fb;color:#3b4256;margin-right:6px}
.gtooltip{position:absolute;background:#1f2430;color:#fff;font-size:12px;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;pointer-events:none;opacity:0;transition:opacity .12s;max-width:340px;line-height:1.5;z-index:60}
/* 本体模型页 */
.onto-wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(420px,1.02fr) minmax(400px,1fr);gap:16px;align-items:stretch}
.onto-card{background:var(--panel);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0}
.onto-card h3{font-size:14.5px;margin-bottom:4px}
.onto-card .sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:12px}
#ontoCanvas{display:block;width:100%;height:calc(100vh - 252px);min-height:400px;border-radius:10px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,#ffffff,#f3f5fb);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.statline{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}
.statline span{background:#f8f9fc;border-radius:8px;padding:4px 9px}
.statline b{color:var(--ink)}
.onto-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap}
.onto-head h3{font-size:14.5px;margin:0}
.onto-acts{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.onto-acts input{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 9px;font-size:12px;width:130px;outline:none}
.onto-acts input:focus{border-color:var(--accent)}
.mini-btn{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:6px 11px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink)}
.mini-btn:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent)}
.mini-btn.primary{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:#fff}
.mini-btn.primary:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);color:#fff}
#editorArea{flex:1;min-height:0;overflow-y:auto}
.o-node{cursor:pointer}
.o-node rect{fill:#fff;stroke-width:2;filter:drop-shadow(0 2px 4px rgba(30,41,80,.12))}
.o-node text{font-size:12px;fill:#1f2430;pointer-events:none;font-weight:600}
.o-node .cnt{font-size:10.5px;fill:var(--muted);font-weight:400}
.o-edge{stroke:#c9d2ea;stroke-width:1.4;opacity:.7}
.o-edge-label{font-size:10px;fill:#868e96;pointer-events:none}
.o-node.sel rect{stroke-width:3}
/* 实例列表 */
.inst-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;max-height:min(240px,26vh);overflow:auto;margin-bottom:10px;flex:0 0 auto}
.inst-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:#f8f9fc;font-size:12.5px;cursor:pointer;border:1.5px solid transparent}
.inst-item:hover{background:#eef2ff}
.inst-item.sel{border-color:var(--accent);background:#fafbff}
.inst-item .nm{flex:1;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
.inst-item .flag{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--warn);flex-shrink:0}
/* 编辑表单 */
.detail-card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:10px;background:#fff}
.detail-card:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.dc-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:6px}
.dc-title{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}
.dc-tag{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--accent);background:#eef2ff;border-radius:12px;padding:1px 8px;white-space:nowrap}
.dc-row{display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:12px;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #f0f2f8;line-height:1.5;align-items:baseline}
.dc-row:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.dc-row .k{color:var(--muted);min-width:76px;flex-shrink:0}
.dc-row .v{color:var(--ink);flex:1;word-break:break-word}
.dc-row .tag{color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;flex-shrink:0;background:#f3f4fa;border-radius:10px;padding:0 7px}
.paper-link{cursor:pointer;border-radius:6px}
.paper-link:hover{background:#fafbff}
.form-row{margin-bottom:12px}
.form-row label{display:block;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:4px;font-weight:600}
.form-row label .req{color:var(--danger);margin-left:3px}
.form-row input,.form-row textarea,.form-row select{width:100%;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;font-size:13px;font-family:inherit;outline:none;background:#fff}
.form-row input:focus,.form-row textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent)}
.rel-line{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin:4px 0;font-size:12.5px;background:#f8f9fc;border-radius:8px;padding:6px 10px}
.rel-line .rel-name{color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;min-width:78px;flex-shrink:0}
.rel-line .rel-obj{flex:1;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
.rel-line .del{cursor:pointer;color:var(--danger);border:none;background:transparent;font-size:13px}
.rel-line.removed{background:#fff5f5;text-decoration:line-through;opacity:.7}
.rel-line.added{background:#f0fdf7}
.add-rel{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:6px}
.add-rel select{flex:1;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 8px;font-size:12px;background:#fff;min-width:0}
.add-rel button{border:none;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;flex-shrink:0}
/* diff */
.diffbox{border:1px solid #f3e6b0;background:#fffdf0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;margin-top:14px}
.diffbox h5{font-size:12.5px;color:#b07800;margin-bottom:8px}
.diff-line{font-size:12px;display:flex;gap:8px;margin:5px 0;line-height:1.5}
.diff-line .k{color:var(--muted);min-width:80px;flex-shrink:0}
.diff-line .old{color:var(--danger);text-decoration:line-through;flex:1;word-break:break-word}
.diff-line .new{color:var(--accent2);flex:1;word-break:break-word}
.act-row{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}
.btn-primary{flex:1;border:none;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:9px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
.btn-primary:hover{filter:brightness(1.08)}
.btn-primary:disabled{background:#b9c4e8;cursor:not-allowed}
.btn-ghost{flex:1;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:9px;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--muted)}
.btn-ghost:hover{color:var(--ink)}
/* 提交结果 / 校验错误 */
.commit-ok{margin-top:12px;border:1px solid #b2f2bb;background:#f0fdf4;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 12px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#2b8a3e}
.commit-err{margin-top:12px;border:1px solid #ffc9c9;background:#fff5f5;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 12px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#c92a2a}
.commit-err ul{margin:6px 0 0 16px}
/* 关联面板 */
#relPanel{position:fixed;right:0;top:84px;bottom:0;width:340px;background:var(--panel);box-shadow:-4px 0 24px rgba(30,41,80,.12);padding:20px;overflow:auto;z-index:40;transform:translateX(105%);transition:transform .25s}
#relPanel.open{transform:translateX(0)}
#relPanel .close{float:right;border:none;background:#f1f3f9;border-radius:7px;padding:4px 10px;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px}
#relPanel h3{font-size:15px;margin:8px 0 4px}
#relPanel .sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:14px}
.rel-sec{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);margin:14px 0 6px}
.rel-item{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:#f8f9fc;margin:4px 0;font-size:12.5px;gap:8px}
.rel-item .tag{font-size:11px;color:var(--accent);background:#eef2ff;border-radius:14px;padding:1px 8px;white-space:nowrap}
.rel-item .act{color:var(--accent);cursor:pointer;font-size:11.5px;white-space:nowrap}
/* AI */
.ai-head{padding:16px 16px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.ai-body{flex:1;overflow:auto;padding:14px 16px}
.ai-card{background:#f7f9ff;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}
.ai-card .hd{font-weight:600;color:var(--accent);font-size:12.5px;margin-bottom:5px}
.ai-card.insight{background:#fffdf0;border:1px solid #f3e6b0}
.ai-card.insight .hd{color:#b07800}
.ai-q{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:13px}
.ai-q input{width:100%;border:none;outline:none;font-size:13px;font-family:inherit;padding:4px 0}
.ai-q .send{margin-top:8px;width:100%;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:8px;padding:8px;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer}
.ai-msg{font-size:12.5px;background:#f1f3f9;border-radius:9px;padding:10px;margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.6}
.ai-msg b{color:var(--accent)}
/* 弹窗 */
#modal,#verModal,#schemaModal,#newModal{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(20,24,40,.45);z-index:100;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
#modal.open,#verModal.open,#schemaModal.open,#newModal.open{display:flex}
.modal-box{width:640px;max-width:94vw;max-height:88vh;background:var(--panel);border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(20,24,40,.3);overflow:auto;padding:24px 26px}
.modal-box.wide{width:760px}
.modal-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}
.modal-head h3{font-size:17px}
.modal-head .x{border:none;background:#f1f3f9;border-radius:8px;width:30px;height:30px;cursor:pointer;font-size:14px}
/* ================= 上传记录弹窗（v1.9） ================= */
#upHistModal{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(20,24,40,.45);z-index:100;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
#upHistModal.open{display:flex}
.up-hist-badge{display:inline-block;min-width:17px;line-height:17px;padding:0 5px;margin-left:6px;border-radius:9px;background:#e3e9ff;color:#3a4bbf;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;font-style:normal;vertical-align:1px}
.up-hist-badge.hidden{display:none}
.switch-btn.has-run{border-color:#c7d3ff;color:#3a4bbf}
.uh-when{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);flex-shrink:0}
.uh-tip{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px;line-height:1.6}
.uh-empty{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:12.5px;padding:26px 0}
.drop{border:2px dashed #c5d0f5;border-radius:14px;padding:36px 20px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13.5px;cursor:pointer;background:#fafbff}
.drop:hover{border-color:var(--accent);background:#f0f4ff}
.drop b{color:var(--accent);font-size:15px}
.pipe{margin-top:16px}
.pstep{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:9px;background:#f8f9fc;margin:6px 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
.pstep .st{width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#e9ecf5;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;flex-shrink:0}
.pstep.done .st{background:var(--accent2)}
.pstep.doing .st{background:var(--accent)}
.pstep.fail .st{background:var(--danger)}
.pstep .nm{flex:1}
.pstep .sts{font-size:12px}
/* ================= 逐文件上传解析进度（v1.7） ================= */
.up-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin:2px 0 10px}
.up-head h4{margin:0}
.up-meta{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.up-list{max-height:54vh;overflow:auto;padding-right:2px}
.up-item{border:1px solid #e6e9f2;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 11px;margin:7px 0;background:#fbfcff}
.up-item.parsing{border-color:#c7d3ff;background:#f6f8ff}
.up-item.done{border-color:#cfe9d8;background:#f7fdf9}
.up-item.failed{border-color:#f2c9cd;background:#fff8f8}
.up-line{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.up-name{flex:1;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.up-badge{font-size:11.5px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:20px;background:#eceffa;color:var(--muted);flex-shrink:0}
.up-item.parsing .up-badge{background:#e3e9ff;color:#3a4bbf}
.up-item.done .up-badge{background:#e0f3e7;color:#1f7a45}
.up-item.failed .up-badge{background:#fde8ea;color:var(--danger)}
.up-time{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);flex-shrink:0;min-width:40px;text-align:right}
.up-bar{height:5px;border-radius:4px;background:#edf0f8;margin:7px 0 5px;overflow:hidden}
.up-bar i{display:block;height:100%;width:0;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#7f8ff5,#4f63e8);transition:width .4s ease}
.up-item.queued .up-bar i{background:#c9d1ea}
.up-item.done .up-bar i{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#57c98a,#2f9e63)}
.up-item.failed .up-bar i{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#e88b93,#cf4a55)}
.up-stage{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.result-group{margin-top:16px}
.result-group h5{font-size:13px;margin-bottom:8px}
.result-group .row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:#f8f9fc;margin:4px 0;font-size:12.5px}
.result-group .dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0}
.result-group .ok .dot{background:var(--accent2)} .result-group .warn .dot{background:var(--warn)} .result-group .bad .dot{background:var(--danger)}
.result-group .row .nm{flex:1;word-break:break-all}
.result-group .row .act{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--accent);cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}
/* 版本列表 */
.ver-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:9px 11px;border-radius:9px;background:#f8f9fc;margin:5px 0;font-size:12.5px}
.ver-item .v{font-weight:600;min-width:112px}
.ver-item .m{flex:1;color:var(--muted);font-size:11.5px}
/* 本体结构编辑 */
.sch-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:10px}
.sch-col h4{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
.sch-list{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;padding:6px;max-height:210px;overflow:auto}
.sch-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:7px;background:#f8f9fc;margin:3px 0;font-size:12px}
.sch-row .k{font-weight:600;min-width:96px}
.sch-row .m{flex:1;color:var(--muted);font-size:11.5px}
.mini-btn{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:7px;padding:3px 9px;font-size:11.5px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--fg)}
.mini-btn:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent)}
.mini-btn.danger:hover{border-color:var(--danger);color:var(--danger)}
.sch-form{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:8px;align-items:center}
.sch-form input,.sch-form select{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;padding:5px 8px;font-size:12px;background:#fff;color:var(--fg);max-width:170px}
.sch-form input{max-width:130px}
.pend{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:6px 9px;border-radius:7px;background:#fff8e6;margin:4px 0;font-size:11.5px}
.pend .t{flex:1}
.pend .x{cursor:pointer;color:var(--danger);font-weight:600}
.sch-tip{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px;line-height:1.6}
.hidden{display:none}
.banner{margin-bottom:14px;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;border:1px solid #ffc9c9;background:#fff5f5;color:#c92a2a}
.banner.info{border-color:#c5d0f5;background:#f7f9ff;color:#3b5bdb}
.loading{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;padding:40px 0}
/* ===================== 阅读板块（ReX 融合） ===================== */
#content.reading{padding:0;overflow:hidden}
#view-read{height:100%}
#view-read.hidden{display:none}
#readStage{position:relative;height:100%;background:#eef1f5;overflow:hidden}
#readFrame{width:100%;height:100%;border:0;display:block;background:#fff}
#readBar{position:absolute;top:10px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:8;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.95);border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 3px 14px rgba(30,41,80,.16);font-size:12.5px;backdrop-filter:blur(10px)}
#readBar.hidden{display:none}
.rb-btn{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:7px;min-width:26px;height:24px;line-height:1;padding:0 8px;cursor:pointer;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink)}
.rb-btn:hover{background:#f1f3f5}
.rb-zoom{min-width:44px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.rb-pg{width:48px;height:24px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;text-align:center;font-size:12.5px;padding:0 2px}
.rb-total{color:var(--muted)}
.rb-sep{width:1px;height:16px;background:var(--line)}
.rb-name{max-width:220px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--muted)}
.read-empty{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#fff;color:var(--muted);font-size:13.5px;padding:0 60px;text-align:center}
.read-empty.hidden{display:none}
#readLoading{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);color:var(--muted);font-size:13.5px;z-index:9}
#readLoading.hidden{display:none}
.spin{width:16px;height:16px;border:2px solid #dee2e6;border-top-color:var(--accent);border-radius:50%;animation:rdspin .7s linear infinite}
@keyframes rdspin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
.rd-err{max-width:420px}
.rd-err-t{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#e03131;margin-bottom:8px}
.rd-err-m{color:#495057;line-height:1.7;word-break:break-all}
.rd-tip{margin-top:10px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.pcard-read{margin-left:8px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:6px;padding:1px 8px;font-size:11.5px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--accent)}
.pcard-read:hover{background:#eef2ff}
.up-read{margin-left:8px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}

/* ---- 右栏 AI 面板（阅读伴随态） ---- */
.ai-body.rd{padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden}
.rd-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.rd-title{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;min-width:0}
.rd-title span:last-child{overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
.rd-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#12b886;flex:none}
.rd-tools{display:flex;gap:6px;flex:none}
.rd-model-line{padding:6px 12px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.rd-msgs{flex:1;overflow:auto;padding:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
.rd-msgs .ai-msg{margin-bottom:0;max-width:96%}
.rd-msgs .ai-msg.u{background:#e7f5ff;align-self:flex-end;max-width:88%}
.rd-msgs .ai-msg.a{background:#f1f3f9;align-self:flex-start}
.rd-welcome{color:var(--muted);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.9}
.rd-w-t{font-weight:600;color:#495057;margin-bottom:6px}
.rd-w-l{font-size:12px}
.rd-quote{border-left:3px solid #7048e8;background:#f6f3ff;color:#5f3dc4;padding:6px 9px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:6px;max-height:110px;overflow:auto}
.rd-input{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px 12px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-end}
.rd-input textarea{flex:1;resize:none;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:7px 9px;font-size:12.5px;font-family:inherit;line-height:1.5;outline:none}
.rd-input textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent)}
.rd-send{border:0;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:0 14px;height:34px;font-size:12.5px;cursor:pointer;flex:none}
.rd-send:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:default}
.rd-toast{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:34px;transform:translate(-50%,12px);background:rgba(33,37,41,.92);color:#fff;font-size:12.5px;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:8px;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s;z-index:300}
.rd-toast.on{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0)}
.rd-mask{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(20,24,40,.45);z-index:200;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.rd-mask.on{display:flex}
.rd-modal{width:520px;max-width:92vw;max-height:86vh;overflow:auto;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(20,24,40,.28)}
.rd-m-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:4px}
.rd-m-head .x{border:0;background:transparent;font-size:20px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--muted);line-height:1}
.rd-m-sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:12px}
.rd-m-tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:12px}
.rd-m-tab{flex:1;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:7px 0;font-size:12.5px;cursor:pointer}
.rd-m-tab.on{background:#eef2ff;border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}
.rd-m-form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
.rd-m-form.hidden{display:none}
.rd-m-form label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;font-size:12px;color:#495057;flex:1}
.rd-m-form input{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;padding:7px 9px;font-size:12.5px;outline:none;font-family:inherit}
.rd-m-form input:focus{border-color:var(--accent)}
.rd-m-row{display:flex;gap:10px}
.rd-m-acts{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.rd-m-out{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;word-break:break-all;min-height:18px;background:#f8f9fa;border-radius:7px;padding:7px 9px}
.rd-m-foot{font-size:11.5px;color:#adb5bd;margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:10px;word-break:break-all}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="topbar">
  <div class="brand"><span class="logo">◆</span>科研文献库</div>
  <div class="tabs">
    <button class="tab active" data-tab="lib">📚 检索</button>
    <button class="tab" data-tab="read">📖 阅读</button>
    <button class="tab" data-tab="onto">🧩 管理</button>
  </div>
  <div class="top-right">
    <button id="btnUpload">⬆ 上传文献</button>
    <button id="btnAI" class="on">🤖 AI 伴随</button>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="statusbar"><span><span class="dot"></span><span id="stConn">连接中…</span></span>
  <div class="right"><span id="stKg">—</span><span id="stVer">—</span></div>
</div>

<div id="main">
  <div id="content">
    <!-- ===== 检索 ===== -->
    <div id="view-lib">
      <div id="libBanner"></div>
      <div class="toolbar">
        <input id="search" placeholder="搜索标题 / 作者 / 关键词…">
        <button class="switch-btn active" id="viewList">☰ 列表</button>
        <button class="switch-btn" id="viewGraph">🕸 图谱</button>
        <button class="switch-btn" id="btnUpHist" title="查看全部上传任务：阶段 / 进度 / 耗时 / 结果，关闭后可随时重开">📋 上传记录<i class="up-hist-badge hidden" id="upHistBadge">0</i></button>
        <span class="viewhint" id="viewHint"></span>
      </div>
      <div id="ctrlBar"></div>
      <div class="lib">
        <div id="paperArea"><div class="loading">正在读取图谱…</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ===== 阅读（ReX 融合：视口最大化 + 工具条内嵌 + 右栏复用 AI 面板） ===== -->
    <div id="view-read" class="hidden">
      <div id="readStage">
        <iframe id="readFrame" title="文献阅读视口" allow="clipboard-write"></iframe>
        <div id="readBar" class="hidden">
          <button class="rb-btn" id="rdZoomOut" title="缩小">−</button>
          <span class="rb-zoom" id="rdZoomLabel">100%</span>
          <button class="rb-btn" id="rdZoomIn" title="放大">＋</button>
          <span class="rb-sep"></span>
          <button class="rb-btn" id="rdFit" title="适合宽度">适合宽度</button>
          <span class="rb-sep"></span>
          <input class="rb-pg" id="rdPage" type="number" min="1" value="1" title="跳转页码">
          <span class="rb-total" id="rdPageTotal">/ 0</span>
          <span class="rb-sep"></span>
          <span class="rb-name" id="rdName"></span>
          <button class="rb-btn" id="rdReload" title="重新载入文献">⟳</button>
        </div>
        <div id="readEmpty" class="read-empty">从检索列表、图谱详情或管理页选择文献后，将在此打开阅读。</div>
        <div id="readLoading" class="hidden"><div class="spin"></div><span id="readLoadingText">正在加载文献…</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ===== 管理（本体模型 · 读写） ===== -->
    <div id="view-onto" class="hidden">
      <div id="ontoBanner"></div>
      <div class="onto-wrap">
        <div class="onto-card">
          <h3>本体结构</h3>
          <div class="sub">类（节点大小 = 实例数）· 对象关系（连线）· 点击类查看实例与编辑</div>
          <svg id="ontoCanvas" viewBox="0 0 1000 720"></svg>
          <div class="statline" id="ontoStats"></div>
          <div style="margin-top:10px"><button class="mini-btn" onclick="openSchemaModal()">编辑本体结构（类 / 属性）</button>
            <span class="sch-tip" id="schHeadTip" style="margin-left:8px">原生定义只读，扩展项可增删改</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="onto-card">
          <div class="onto-head">
            <h3 id="ontoTitle">选择左侧类</h3>
            <div class="onto-acts">
              <input id="instSearch" placeholder="过滤实例…">
              <button class="mini-btn" id="btnVersions">版本 / 回滚</button>
              <button class="mini-btn primary" id="btnNewInst">+ 新建实例</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="sub" id="ontoSub"></div>
          <div class="inst-list" id="instList"></div>
          <div id="editorArea"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="aiPanel" class="on">
    <div class="ai-head"><span>🤖 AI 伴随</span><button class="x" onclick="toggleAI()">×</button></div>
    <div class="ai-body" id="aiBody"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="relPanel"></div>
<div class="gtooltip" id="gtip"></div>

<!-- 上传弹窗 -->
<div id="modal">
  <div class="modal-box">
    <div class="modal-head"><h3>上传文献</h3><button class="x" onclick="closeModal()">×</button></div>
    <div id="uploadStep">
      <div class="drop" id="dropZone">
        <b>拖拽文件到这里，或点击选择</b><br><br>
        支持 PDF（可多选）。上传后自动解析元数据、AI 补全摘要关键词、校验并入库
      </div>
      <input type="file" id="fileInput" multiple accept=".pdf" class="hidden">
      <p style="margin-top:10px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)" id="uploadHint"></p>
    </div>
    <div id="pipeStep" class="hidden">
      <div class="up-head">
        <h4 id="upTitle">AI 解析治理中…</h4>
        <span class="up-meta" id="upMeta"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="up-list" id="upList"></div>
      <div class="result-group hidden" id="uploadResult"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 上传记录弹窗（常驻入口：检索页工具栏「📋 上传记录」） -->
<div id="upHistModal">
  <div class="modal-box wide">
    <div class="modal-head"><h3>上传记录</h3><button class="x" onclick="closeUpHist()">×</button></div>
    <div class="up-head"><h4 id="uhTitle">全部上传任务</h4><span class="up-meta" id="uhMeta"></span></div>
    <div id="uhList" class="up-list"><div class="uh-empty">读取中…</div></div>
    <p class="uh-tip">记录保存在后端（最近 50 条），含文件名、当前阶段、进度、耗时与入库结果；关闭本弹窗不影响解析，任务状态不会丢失，上传完成后仍可随时回看。</p>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 版本弹窗 -->
<div id="verModal">
  <div class="modal-box wide">
    <div class="modal-head"><h3>版本快照 / 回滚</h3><button class="x" onclick="closeVerModal()">×</button></div>
    <div class="sub" style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:10px">每次提交（commit / 回滚）都会生成快照，回滚将用所选快照整体覆盖当前图谱。</div>
    <div id="verList"><div class="loading">读取中…</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 本体结构编辑弹窗 -->
<div id="schemaModal">
  <div class="modal-box wide">
    <div class="modal-head"><h3>编辑本体结构</h3><button class="x" onclick="closeSchemaModal()">×</button></div>
    <div class="sub" style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px">扩展类 / 属性提交后写入 schema_ext.json，并重写 edu_scholar_ontology.ttl 与 SHACL 的扩展区；提交前自动备份原生文件。原生定义（基线）只读。</div>
